WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.960
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.220
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.060
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.560
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.940
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:51.480
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.620
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.810
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.980
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.860
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.450
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.030
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:43.330
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.420
Someone once said...

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.340
There's a kind of chihuahua that 
has the sweetest, fluffiest ears

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:00.850
made out of wonderful waffles...

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:05.810
Chihuawaffle!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.980
There are saltwater mussels 
that taste first-rate,

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:19.360
but are also the life of any party 
as they tap out a fun rhythm...

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:25.540
Saltwater Rhythmussels!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.670
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:36.960
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.930
Ichiryu ventured into the Gourmet World

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.350
to meet Midora, boss of the Gourmet Corp.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.650
But the leading members of the 
Gourmet Corp. stood in his way.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.820
Shall we dine together again?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:04.740
Little brother...

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:11.460
Ichiryu proposed sharing the 
legendary ingredient, GOD,

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.920
but Midora sneered at the idea.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.460
That's one wish that's not coming true.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.930
I'm going to possess GOD.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.760
It'll result in war.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.100
Everyone in the Gourmet Corp...

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.600
If it does come to war...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.570
...I'm not going to be this good-natured.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:38.940
Be careful.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.120
Ichiryu returned from the Gourmet World

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.660
and stocked up on energy to 
prepare for the coming battle.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.090
We'll never sit down at the same table again.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.000
The future, as always, is entrusted to

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.090
those who sit down at one table.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.010
Meanwhile, Toriko arrived at a new place

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:09.140
in search of a clue that would lead 
to the next training ingredient.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:17.690
Hidden Training Ingredient! Emergency 
Instructions from Ichiryu!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.620
Stained glass flowers... Stained Glaflowers!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.630
Lotus flowers with leaves of 
traditional paper... Papyrlotus!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:53.770
Quick-drying lacquer that's as 
strong as cement... Lacement!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.230
They don't call this the 
Artisan Forest for nothing.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.230
There sure are a lot of materials that 
can be used for traditional crafts.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.820
Hey, man!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.950
Hi! Are you a craftsman from Skill Garden?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.950
I'm lookin' for a fortune-teller 
by the name of Monchy...

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.240
Shhh!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.910
Don't walk around here talking at 
the top of your voice like that!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.660
It'll find us!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.290
It?

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.840
Oh... Oh... Oh, no!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.510
T-There it is!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:33.560
Devil Plant Horse (Plant 
Beast) Capture Level 35

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.520
That's a Devil Plant Horse!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.150
Its body armor is not only incredibly strong,

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.530
but it's also supposed to 
be as elastic as bamboo!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.030
Hide!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.580
G-G-Got it!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.510
It looks like you're serious 
about eatin' me, huh?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.470
What the...?!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.850
Fork Shield!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.520
Flying Knife!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:21.940
Wha...?!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.020
Damn, it's fast!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.440
Flying Knife!

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.530
How agile is it?!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:33.410
It might be faster than the Hanya Panda!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.170
Devil Plant Horse... How 'bout this?!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.220
Huh?! He ran away?!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:56.930
Flying Fork!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.650
Fork Shield!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.910
That lacquer will harden quickly 
and keep it from moving.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.210
18-fold Spiked Punch!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.650
That's amazing!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.940
Are you hurt?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.900
Nope! I'm as fine as I look!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.530
He beat it?!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.280
For real?!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:50.860
I don't believe it!

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.530
Everyone! This guy chased it away!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.820
Great job!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:55.530
Incredible!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.780
Hey, come on now...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:01.790
Thanks to that Beast, we haven't been 
able to go out and get supplies.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.080
I'm really grateful to you!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.790
Moreover, this is fine material!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.510
A little work and we'll be able 
to make something nice out of it!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.090
Bozo! I'm gonna use 'em all to make 
sushi trays for my restaurant!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.930
What are you talking 
about?! Don't get greedy!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.310
That's right, Monchy!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:19.850
Monchy?!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.060
<i>You're</i> Monchy?!

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:31.940
That's right! I'm the fortune-telling 
sushi craftsman, Monchy!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.860
But you didn't already 
know that, you big ape?!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.990
Fortune-telling Sushi
Monchy

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.990
A training ingredient?!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.160
Sushi

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:44.750
Yeah. I'm in a bind 'cause I don't know 
where to look for that ingredient.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.790
Seems it's even too hard for 
Coco's powers of divination...

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.090
So...? So...? So, go on!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:58.680
So I came here thinkin' you'd 
be able to help me find it.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:02.640
Leave it to me! It'll be an easy task!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.770
A Brain Buster at the same 
time the gong's struck!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.480
And just like that, the 
count goes to three, bozo!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.570
What the hell's with this guy?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.820
Anyway, you did chase away that Beast...

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.490
That really helped us out.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.320
Still, this sushi's delicious!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.580
Are you even listening to me, bozo?!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.040
And how much are you gonna eat?!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.420
My sixth training ingredient...

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.210
It's in the Lost Forest.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:38.010
W-Wait a second... L-L...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.260
Lost Forest?!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.560
What are you, stupid?!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.720
Wha...?!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.940
It's no simple thing to 
divine about that place!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.980
Y-You can't do it?

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.320
I didn't say that!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.650
But if you really want me to 
divine a huge place like that,

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:59.240
you're gonna have to get me some 
fillings that suit the occasion!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.280
F-Fillings?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.590
Tom-san, thank you very much 
for flying me out here.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.590
Hey, it ain't no thang!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.380
If it's a favor for Toriko, no problemo!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.510
To Komatsu, let's have dinner. Toriko

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.470
Is that a letter?

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.680
It's farther than I thought...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.680
Where is Toriko-san waiting?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.100
We're here!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.100
We're here?

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.440
We're in the middle of the air!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.440
It's right below us. You're gonna jump.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.360
Skydiving!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.530
W-W-Wait a minute! I can't do that!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.910
It'll be fine! Toriko did 
it himself when he got here.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:51.080
Give me a break! For Toriko-san, 
I'm sure it was like...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.750
Thanks, Tom! See ya!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.760
That didn't sound like him!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:02.140
Don't do this!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.270
I'm saved?

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.280
Ow!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.450
Ouch...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:26.950
Glad you could make it, Komatsu!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.290
T-Toriko-san!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.330
I thought I was gonna die!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:39.550
If you come here by boat, you run the 
danger of bein' attacked by sea Beasts.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.010
The only way to get here is by air.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.300
R-Really?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.390
But come on, skydiving?!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:52.480
By the way... what in 
the world is this place?

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.230
Biotope 2.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:12:02.780
B-Biotope 2?!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.690
Wow!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:54.620
Biotope 2 is a research facility 
devoted to the study of seafood.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.880
There sure is an incredible variety here.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:41.130
This part of the facility 
is open to the public.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.590
Really?!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.550
Shuttle Turtle
For the Undersea Restaurant

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.280
Toriko-san, that's...

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.910
...a Slug Whale!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.240
That's a Squid Tuna!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.120
A Checkered Tortoise!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.580
Yeah...

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.620
What's wrong, Toriko-san?

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.420
You seem a little depressed today.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.920
Don't tell me you've got something 
weighing on your mind?

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:27.220
Look, even I have things to worry about.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.380
Once in a great while...

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.930
Really?!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:35.350
What is it that's on your mind, 
Toriko-san?! I'm all ears!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.190
Welcome to the Undersea Restaurant.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.520
I'll show you to your table.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:35.990
This is a wonderful restaurant!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.330
I've brought your meals.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:44.630
This is a scallop that tastes like 
beef tenderloin... Scalloploin Steak.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.920
And this is Oyster Milk Cream Spaghetti...

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:53.340
Fatty Tuna Lobster, grilled to perfection...

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:58.640
Squid that tastes like 
potatoes, fried Potatoesquid.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:03.810
And Plumelon Soda completes this set meal.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.190
Everything looks delicious!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:12.200
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.860
Thank you for the food!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:24.080
The deep taste of the 
scallop mixes in my mouth

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.960
with the light yet juicy 
flavor of beef tenderloin!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.680
The rich sauce of the Oyster Milk combines

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:40.390
with the wonderfully textured 
noodles to melt in my mouth!

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:46.980
The sweetness of fatty tuna with 
the soft feel of lobster...

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.270
I can't get enough!

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.280
The refreshing taste of plums and 
the first-rate sweetness of melons!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.410
Plumelon Soda is fantastic, too!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:02.330
The aromatic flavor of crisp french fries...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:06.420
...and the sophisticated sweetness 
of squid lingers in the mouth!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.580
Delicious!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.960
Come to think of it, Toriko-san,

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.470
weren't you saying you had 
something on your mind?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.760
Yeah...

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.090
See, I didn't know

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.760
the location of a training ingredient 
the old man wants me to find...

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:25.640
The Lost Forest is said to be the biggest 
sea of trees in the Human World.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.770
I know it's in there,

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:34.280
but the area is so vast that 
I can't pinpoint its location.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:39.490
So I went to ask Monchy, the 
Gourmet Fortune Teller...

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:43.040
M-Monchy, the Gourmet Fortune Teller?!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.040
Who's that?!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.380
He's a sushi craftsman who 
lives in Skill Garden.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.590
Monchy's divination was a little odd...

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.100
Fortune Roll?

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.970
Yeah. I divine the location of ingredients

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.230
by the direction my Fortune Roll is facing.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:11.020
And by direction, I mean the direction 
that the God of Fortune is in.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:16.990
He could be here... or here... 
Every year, it changes a little.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:23.870
North Northeast East Southeast 
South Southwest West Northwest

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.860
I see... So if you eat the 
Fortune Roll in the direction

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:23.620
of where good fortune is in that 
year, you get good luck, huh?

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.000
What are you, a moron?! In this Gourmet Age,

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:31.960
they say that the best fortune is 
found where the ingredients are!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:38.880
And so, Monchy needs specific 
ingredients to make his Fortune Roll.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.430
Th-That's an original style 
of fortune-telling, huh?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.430
But it's 100% accurate.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.140
O-One hundred percent?!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.190
However, depending on the ingredient 
that's being divined for,

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:56.900
the type of and amount of necessary 
fillings for the Fortune Roll change...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.900
...apparently...

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.280
And if I don't get ahold 
of those fillings for him,

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.820
Monchy won't make the Fortune Roll.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:11.250
So I came here to see if some kind of 
seafood would make for decent filling...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.460
But considering that I'll 
be goin' to the Lost Forest,

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.760
I think a more novel 
ingredient is called for...

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.100
I apologize for interrupting 
your meal, Toriko-sama.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.930
I have a message from the president...

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.140
From the old man?!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:32.690
It seems that Stew Pond has frozen over.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.560
What?!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.360
Stew Pond has...?!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:44.030
Many people want to nominate it 
as a Gourmet World Heritage site,

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.200
with its pond water of boiling soup stock.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:52.460
The pond is like the highest quality stew!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.590
Stew Pond has frozen over?!

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:01.760
Therefore, he would like you to capture 
the mistress that inhabits Stew Pond...

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.890
Madam Fish.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:11.180
The president has ordered all Four 
Kings to take on this challenge.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:16.190
What?! A-All Four Kings?!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.120
In those younger days,

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.040
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:34.580
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.920
After that, time passed

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.420
Were you able to grasp

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:45.050
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.760
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.980
You turn into a coward,

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:59.440
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:04.320
So now's the time!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:12.000
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.250
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.290
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:23.130
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:27.010
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.970
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.180
We're going to use a camera 
later, so get yours ready!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.600
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.400
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:47.490
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.620
Alright, here we go!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.080
A heaping helping...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.200
Open!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.670
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:07.430
A - Jack Elephant Capture Level 85

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.130
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.670
A lot of things may have 
a soothing effect on you.

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.430
It looks like you'll have a relaxing week!

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:16.520
B Jet Black Rice Capture Level 30

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:11.390
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.020
If you act decisively, it seems things 
will be heading in a good direction.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:16.520
Muster up your courage!

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:25.530
C - Mimic Bagworm Capture Level 12

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:20.520
And I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.150
Be careful not to be too lazy!

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:25.530
If you find yourself with free time, 
light exercise may be a good idea!

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:29.360
And now, it's Gourmet Good 
Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.070
Are you ready?

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:34.040
One of Toriko's friends will 
appear with some words of wisdom.

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:39.710
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:36.200
If you take a photo of the scene,

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:39.710
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:41.420
Alright, here we go!

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:45.760
3... 2... 1... Scoop chance!

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:49.220
In the direction you're aiming for...

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:52.680
...something important is waiting for you!

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.640
Have faith and move forward... bozo.

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:00.400
Maybe I'll bring some kind 
of filling to Monchy-san too,

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:01.730
so he can help me find a scoop...

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:05.070
And now, our next segment... Enjoy!

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:09.860
At long last, the Toriko anime reaches it's 100th episode!

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:12.320
And the prey to celebrate this occasion? The Madam Fish!

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:14.200
Who's going to reel it in!?

00:23:14.430 --> 00:23:17.620
The Four Kings Assemble to Mark the 100th Episode!

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:19.560
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
